    "detailed_description": "an adventure platformer that will change the universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.poster.avif?t=1755147984\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.webm?t=1755147984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/17cd92d0e54e36f72345d48d8a75ca51.mp4?t=1755147984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>explore fields of warm grass and wildflowers. glide through the sky with your leaf. elude predating fauna, or make mischief instead.<br><br>Merp in Merpworld evokes the feeling of classic Gamegirl Color platformers, but includes modern niceties such as widescreen support, high refresh rate support, and a hi-def, heart-pumping soundtrack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424550/extras/2c8304de29a41c98191031760092a449.webp?t=1755147984\" width=616 height=36 /></span><br><br>maybell and these collaborators created Merp in Merpworld:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPOSER</h2>@simplycyndi<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER ART</h2>@elliesprites<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COVER ART</h2>Lur Noise",
